        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.\r\rAn anonymous client has ordered the quiet termination of two crewmembers aboard the yacht.\r\rThe primary target is Head Chef, James Potts, currently revovering from what was officially reported as a severe kitchen accident. The second target is  bartender Alex Perry. Perry&apos;s only offense seems to be showing sympathy toward the shaken and newly distressed chef, a kindess our client believes is complicity.\r\rInnocent or not, the contract is clear.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
